    {
      "uuid": "f89b7328-fdea-4fdc-889b-7328fdea4fdc",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 283,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: snake\n---\n# Welcome to Nova Snake\n\nThis project was created from the **snake** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.",
