        "artifactHash": "d6c27909df5aca421375de203a25da10203e01b63d778528f99fb40bca5e7113",
        "contentHash": "d6c27909df5aca421375de203a25da10203e01b63d778528f99fb40bca5e7113",
        "cacheKey": "d6c27909df5aca421375de203a25da10203e01b63d778528f99fb40bca5e7113",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: snake\n---\n# Welcome to Nova Snake\n\nThis project was created from the **snake** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.",
        "error": "",
